# User-uploaded content (videos, images, KYC docs) must never be committed — it gets
# written straight to disk per-environment (Backend/uploads locally, /var/www/uploades
# on the live server) and committing it makes `git reset --hard` on deploy overwrite/
# resurrect live uploads in a folder the server never actually serves from.
Backend/uploads/
